  <div class="about-intro"><span class="eyebrow">02 / THE THINKING BEHIND IT</span><h2 id="about-title">The right fit<br>starts with <em>context.</em></h2><p>I'm Arik. I enjoy working out why something is difficult, and what would make it easier. My background in software helps me turn that understanding into something people can use.</p><p>Analysis, engineering, and AI are parts of that work. The goal is a solution that fits the people, the constraints, and the way things actually run.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Say hello <Arrow /></a></div>
  <div class="practice"><span class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS I CARE ABOUT</span><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Understand before adding.</h3><p>Sometimes the best first step is simplifying a process. The problem should guide the scope.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Choose with a reason.</h3><p>Use software and AI where they help. Keep the trade-offs clear and the moving parts manageable.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Check it in real life.</h3><p>A working demo is a start. Test with real tasks, listen to feedback, and refine what gets in the way.</p></div></article></div>
